cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Hibiscus Station in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Hibiscus Station: the robot-side app for LeRobot SO-100/SO-101 arms"
abstract: >-
  Hibiscus Station runs next to a LeRobot SO-100/SO-101 arm: calibration, cameras, teleoperation,
  dataset recording with per-motor health telemetry and a thermal safe stop, upload to a Hibiscus
  training server, running trained policies with live camera feeds, and block programs built from
  recorded trajectories and camera detectors. It ships as Docker images for PCs, NVIDIA Jetson and
  Raspberry Pi 5, and as a Python package.
authors:
  - alias: Bigkatoan
  - name: "The Hibiscus contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Bigkatoan/hibiscus-station"
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
version: "0.2.10"
date-released: "2026-11-20"
keywords:
  - robotics
  - imitation learning
  - lerobot
  - so-101
  - teleoperation
  - motor telemetry
references:
